@host = http://localhost:8080/api
@buyerToken = replace-with-buyer-jwt
@sellerToken = replace-with-secondhand-seller-jwt
@otherBuyerToken = replace-with-other-buyer-jwt

### UC16 发布闲置
POST {{host}}/secondhand/seller
Authorization: Bearer {{sellerToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "D演示闲置教材",
  "description": "软件工程课程资料，九成新",
  "originPrice": 120.00,
  "salePrice": 60.00,
  "categoryId": 1,
  "subCategoryId": 101,
  "conditionLevel": "LIKE_NEW",
  "isNegotiable": 1
}

### UC16 查询我的闲置
GET {{host}}/secondhand/seller/list?pageNum=1&pageSize=10
Authorization: Bearer {{sellerToken}}

### UC17 二手直接购买（替换 productId）
POST {{host}}/secondhand/1/buy
Authorization: Bearer {{buyerToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "receiverName": "张三",
  "receiverPhone": "13800000002",
  "receiverProvince": "北京市",
  "receiverCity": "北京市",
  "receiverDetailAddress": "海淀区中关村软件园"
}

### UC17 支付二手订单（替换 orderId）
POST {{host}}/order/1/pay
Authorization: Bearer {{buyerToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "payMode": "THIRD_PARTY",
  "payChannel": "WECHAT"
}

### UC18 买家发起议价
POST {{host}}/secondhand/trade/bargain/apply
Authorization: Bearer {{otherBuyerToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "productId": 1,
  "offerPrice": 48.00,
  "message": "可以便宜一些吗？"
}

### UC18 卖家同意义价并生成待付款订单
POST {{host}}/secondhand/trade/bargain/confirm
Authorization: Bearer {{sellerToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "negotiationId": 1
}

### UC18 卖家拒绝议价（替换 negotiationId）
POST {{host}}/secondhand/trade/bargain/1/reject
Authorization: Bearer {{sellerToken}}

### UC19 卖家发起拍卖
POST {{host}}/secondhand/trade/auction
Authorization: Bearer {{sellerToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "productId": 1,
  "startPrice": 50.00,
  "incrementAmount": 5.00,
  "durationMinutes": 60
}

### UC19 买家查看商品拍卖
GET {{host}}/secondhand/trade/auction/product/1
Authorization: Bearer {{buyerToken}}

### UC19 买家参与竞拍（替换 auctionId）
POST {{host}}/secondhand/trade/auction/1/bid
Authorization: Bearer {{otherBuyerToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "bidPrice": 65.00
}

### UC19 卖家查看拍卖监控
GET {{host}}/secondhand/trade/auction/seller/list?pageNum=1&pageSize=10
Authorization: Bearer {{sellerToken}}

### UC20 卖家查看我卖出的二手订单
GET {{host}}/order/seller/list?productType=SECONDHAND&pageNum=1&pageSize=10
Authorization: Bearer {{sellerToken}}

### UC20 卖家确认发货（替换 orderId）
POST {{host}}/order/1/ship
Authorization: Bearer {{sellerToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "originProvince": "北京市",
  "originCity": "北京市",
  "originDetail": "海淀区中关村软件园 D 组验收发货点"
}

### UC20 买家查看二手订单
GET {{host}}/order/list?productType=SECONDHAND&pageNum=1&pageSize=10
Authorization: Bearer {{buyerToken}}

### UC20 买家确认收货（替换 orderId）
POST {{host}}/order/1/confirm-receive
Authorization: Bearer {{buyerToken}}
